OL,3,GNEWSATeen accused of murder denies
OL,4,Abeing in turf war
OL,5,
OL,6,FJurors in a murder trial have been told
OL,7,Fthe fatal stabbing of a 21-year-old in
OL,8,FChelmsford was the result of a "turf
OL,9,Fwar between drug dealers".
OL,11,FRadwan Shakur, known to his friends as
OL,12,FRads, died after being stabbed through
OL,13,Fthe heart in Central Park on 12 June.
OL,15,FAt Chelmsford Crown Court, prosecutors
OL,16,Falleged Blaise Mfinda, 18, and a
OL,17,F17-year-old boy acted together when
OL,18,Fconfronting Shakur shortly before his
OL,19,Fdeath.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,376,370,200,160,0,100
