OL,3,GNEWSATeen accused of murder denies
OL,4,Abeing in turf war
OL,5,
OL,6,FOpening the prosecution case, Justin
OL,7,FRouse KC said the defendants believed
OL,8,Fthe area was "their patch" and they
OL,9,Fviewed Shakur as a rival drug dealer.
OL,10,FBoth defendants deny murder.
